@startuml Home Screen – Sequence Diagram
title Home Screen · Key Sequences

skinparam defaultFontName Roboto
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFA
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2E7D32

actor User
participant "HomeScreen" as UI
participant "AlarmListViewModel" as VM
participant "IAlarmRepository" as Repo

== Browse Alarms ==

UI -> VM : collect(alarms)
activate VM
VM -> Repo : getAll()
Repo --> VM : Flow<List<Alarm>>
VM --> UI : StateFlow<List<Alarm>>
deactivate VM

== Search Alarms ==

User -> UI : type in search bar
UI -> VM : search("rain")
VM -> Repo : search("rain")
Repo --> VM : Flow<List<Alarm>> (filtered)
VM --> UI : updated StateFlow

== Enable / Disable Single Alarm ==

User -> UI : tap toggle on alarm card
UI -> VM : setEnabled([id], true)
VM -> Repo : setEnabled([id], true)
Repo --> VM : Unit
note right : Flow re-emits updated list

== Select Mode (Bulk Operations) ==

User -> UI : long-press alarm card
UI -> UI : enter select mode
User -> UI : tap/drag to select multiple
User -> UI : tap "Disable" button
UI -> VM : setEnabled([id1, id2, id3], false)
VM -> Repo : setEnabled([id1, id2, id3], false)
Repo --> VM : Unit

== Bulk Delete ==

User -> UI : tap "Delete" in select mode
UI -> UI : show confirmation dialog
User -> UI : confirm
UI -> VM : delete([id1, id2, id3])
VM -> Repo : delete([id1, id2, id3])
Repo --> VM : Unit

== Navigation ==

User -> UI : tap FAB (+)
UI -> UI : navigate to SetupScreen (create)

User -> UI : tap alarm card
UI -> UI : navigate to SetupScreen (edit, alarmId)

User -> UI : tap AI sparkle button
UI -> UI : navigate to AIPromptDialog

@enduml
